.git
.github
**/*.md

# Dependencies and builds
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Secrets and local config
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Logs and OS files
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db

# Generated runtime data (data/mock stays in the image)
api/data/raw
api/data/real
api/data/db
api/data/runtime
